@Node "What"
@Title "What is SmartShow                     Dial Wastelands [+46(8)157472]"

 SmartShow is a door developed to display a TXT file eg.
 like a door list or a member list for a group.
 it will bring the following to youre system :

   * Simple configurator (Just use from CLI!).
   * Request selector for the TXT file to show.
   * Fast Statestics function (Displays No. of usages).
   * Reliable & Fast.
   * Works on ALL OS and CPU's (If not - Contact me).

@EndNode

