@Node "CliUsage"
@Title "CLI Usage                             Dial Wastelands [+46(8)157472]"

SmartShow-CliConfig V1.0 [RELEASE 1] by NiGHTSHADE.
All rights reserved. Not for commercial use.

  Usage : SmartShowCfg10.0x0 <Command>

  Where <Command> is one of:

  File    Selects a file by ASL.
  Reset   Resets the statestics.
  Remove  Remove the data file.


@EndNode
@Node "DoorUsage"
@Title "Door Usage                            Dial Wastelands [+46(8)157472]"

 How to use it :

   * To simple, just enters it and it will display the TXT file seclected
     from the CLI configurator - If not it will displays a error message.
   * At the bottom line to the right is the total no. of usages of the door.

@EndNode


